<title>USA: Alex. Brown drops AMETEK coverage.</title>
<headline>Alex. Brown drops AMETEK coverage.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it dropped coverage of Ametek Inc.</p>
<p>-- reason for the action was not immediately known.</p>
<p>-- shares were unchanged at 20-1/4.</p>
</text>
